Table openedx_ledger_salescontractreferenceprovider {
  id integer [pk, increment]
  created datetime [not null, note: 'default in Python: now()']
  modified datetime [not null, note: 'default in Python: now()']
  name varchar(255) [not null, note: 'The pretty name of the contract reference provider.']
  slug varchar(32) [unique, not null, note: 'A unique slug for this sales contract reference provider.']

  Note: '''All possible providers for sales contracts.

Typically your sales contracts are recorded within one centralized system-of-record (e.g. SalesForce), in which case
this table may only ever have one single record to describe that provider.

.. no_pii:

Columns from TimeStampedModel (abstract): created, modified.'''
}

